flowchart LR
    Source["Source Word Document<br/><br/>One large document containing:<br/>• Content and formatting<br/>• Embedded images<br/>• Tables and headings<br/>• Table of contents<br/>• Other generated document elements"]

    Temporary["1. Temporary Markdown Extraction<br/><br/>Intermediate working artifact containing:<br/>• Extracted text<br/>• Headings and subheadings<br/>• Tables<br/>• Image links<br/>• Separately extracted image files<br/><br/>NOT maintained content<br/>NOT a published output"]

    Analyze["2. Analyze Source and Temporary Extraction<br/><br/>Assess:<br/>• Document size and structure<br/>• Heading hierarchy and topics<br/>• Tables, images, links and references<br/>• Authored content vs. generated elements<br/>• Potential content loss or extraction defects"]

    Recommend["3. Recommend Content Organization<br/><br/>Determine whether content should be:<br/>• Maintained as one file<br/>• Split into smaller topic files<br/>• Organized with separate metadata<br/><br/>Recommend suitable maintainable format"]

    Decide{"4. User Decision<br/><br/>• Accept or override organization?<br/>• Desired output formats?<br/>• Templates to apply?<br/>• One document or multiple outputs?"}

    Canonical["5. Create Maintainable Canonical Content<br/><br/>Content authors maintain only:<br/>• Business content<br/>• Simple headings and subheadings<br/>• Tables<br/>• Image links<br/>• Essential links and references<br/><br/>Markdown may be the canonical format"]

    Generated["Generate Derived Elements by Code<br/><br/>Not maintained manually:<br/>• Table of contents<br/>• Navigation<br/>• Keyword summaries<br/>• Indexes<br/>• Cross-document listings<br/>• Other derived metadata"]

    Templates["Apply Reusable Templates<br/><br/>Presentation kept separate:<br/>• Manual<br/>• Procedure<br/>• Policy<br/>• Training material"]

    Outputs["Produce Desired Outputs<br/><br/>Canonical Content<br/>+ Generated Elements<br/>+ Template<br/><br/>• Markdown pages<br/>• SharePoint / HTML<br/>• Word / PDF<br/>• Training content<br/>• Future Copilot knowledge source"]

    Source --> Temporary --> Analyze --> Recommend --> Decide

    Decide -- "Override" --> Analyze
    Decide -- "Confirm" --> Canonical

    Canonical --> Generated
    Canonical --> Templates

    Canonical --> Outputs
    Generated --> Outputs
    Templates --> Outputs

